<title>UK: Algeria raises May Saharan Blend crude price - trade.</title>
<headline>Algeria raises May Saharan Blend crude price - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria has agreed contract prices for most May sales of Saharan Blend crude oil at 46 cents above benchmark Dated Brent, a term contract holder said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It seems all done and dusted at (Dated Brent) +46 cents,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Another contract holder said he had heard a range from Dated Brent +46 to Dated Brent +48 cents for the May barrels.</p>
<p>This was an increase on the month from Dated Brent +38/42 cents in April.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
